Z||000004||Ken Wittlief||06-08-2001||03:12 PM||||It totally blows me away when you hear about one nut with a knife or a gun, who kills or injures a lot of people<P>and it aways seems like nobody confronts the guy.<P>esp things like that case a while back where a couple of thugs with, i think one gun, marched several people into the back room of a resturant and shot them all one at a time.<P> I figure if someone is threatening me with a gun or a knife, then they are planning on killing me (ie you never point a gun at someone unless you intend to kill them).<P>  if its one person with a weapon against several unarmed people, he may take out a few of us, but not all of us.<P>  If im ever in such a situation I not going down without a fight. Guns are not like they portray them on TV and in the movies, you can get shot several times and still have some fight left in you.<P>  I have also told my family, if someone ever approaches you in a public place (parking lot for example) with a weapon, and tells you to get in a vehicle, to fight back or flee. They are gonna try to kill you sooner or later. Your chances of surviving are much greater if you are shot and left in a mall parking lot, than in a deserted corner of the woods.||||reg||1
